Neil Hyde founded Juniper Health to make information about long-term health conditions and disability benefits easier to find, easier to understand and easier to act on.

Neil writes and edits the guides on this website. Every guide is based on official and trusted sources, including GOV.UK, the law on legislation.gov.uk, the NHS and NICE, and is checked against them before it is published and at least once a year after that.

## What Neil writes about

- Personal Independence Payment (PIP)
- Attendance Allowance
- Disability Living Allowance for children
- Fibromyalgia

## Get in touch

You can contact Neil at hello@juniperhealth.app. Read our [editorial policy](/about/editorial-policy/) to see how we research, write and check our guides.
